# by class (f64, bool, any other integer class): its slots are loaded into the multi-value return
# registers as `return (t.0, t.1);` loads them (rax, rdx[, r3]; every load before the moves that
# set rdx / r3), and it lands as that arm lands (EJMP0 + rp_vec), so the defer walker, EDEFER_SAVE
